"Estimated": "Estimé",
"Estimated = {0} × {1} × {2} × (({3} + {4})/2) × {5} ÷ {6} × {7} = {8} Tolerated = {9} × {10} × {11} × {12} × {13} ÷ {14} × {15} = {16} Mitigated = {17} × {18} × {19} = {20} Residual = {21} − {22} = {23} Ratio = {24} ÷ {25} = {26}": "Estimé = {0} × {1} × {2} × (({3} + {4})/2) × {5} ÷ {6} × {7} = {8} Toléré = {9} × {10} × {11} × {12} × {13} ÷ {14} × {15} = {16} Atténué = {17} × {18} × {19} = {20} Résiduel = {21} − {22} = {23} Ratio = {24} ÷ {25} = {26}",
"Estimated risk = Pb(A) × Pb(ψ,A) × CVSS × ((δe + δm)/2) × μ(E) / θ × factor. Tolerated risk uses the appetite instead of the damages. Mitigated = estimated × red_p × red_i; residual = estimated − mitigated. The verified engine does it; AI never does.": "Risque estimé = Pb(A) × Pb(ψ,A) × CVSS × ((δe + δm)/2) × μ(E) / θ × facteur. Le risque toléré utilise l'appétit plutôt que les dommages. Atténué = estimé × red_p × red_i; résiduel = estimé − atténué. Le moteur vérifié effectue le calcul; l'IA ne le fait jamais.",
"Estimated size: about": "Taille estimée : environ",
"Estimated size: about {0}": "Taille estimée : environ {0}",
"Estimated, tolerated, mitigated and residual risk of every scenario, with the ratio and its band. Include or exclude scenarios from the portfolio.": "Risque estimé, toléré, atténué et résiduel de chaque scénario, avec le ratio et sa bande. Incluez ou excluez des scénarios du portefeuille.",
"Evaluate against tolerance": "Évaluer par rapport à la tolérance",
